to=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e65a75822a4b2555cea8543182a3d20, https://si.imgix.net/10fd3477/uploads/origins/a23dd0a3-36f2-439b-bdac-b6d2c22e80a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89249a5a85805c6e9164c9bb57e88361 2x, https://si.imgix.net/10fd3477/uploads/origins/a23dd0a3-36f2-439b-bdac-b6d2c22e80a7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=03ea36a99596ee07a77fd60c12ef429e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I love your art style!\nMay I request my OC, Mimi (https://sta.sh/025kca6wnjgf)\nI would like it in this style - https://skeb.jp/@momo_mzm/works/1\n\nShe is a demon bunny who loves naps and plushies\nHer hair is about waist long and has floppy bunny ears\nFor the fullbody can she be yawning/looking sleepy\nThe chibis she can be:\n- hugging a plushie version of her bunny form (https://sta.sh/0140tx2vrjg0)\n- looking cute/shy\n- sleeping with her bunny form\n- whatever else you think looks cute\n\nThank you for your consideration c:", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@momo_mzm/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6666b8ff/uploads/origins/3a6bdd52-c686-4f28-a8af-15ae177129a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b4a7010fc6277d98e774f87185ef495", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6666b8ff/uploads/origins/3a6bdd52-c686-4f28-a8af-15ae177129a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9b4a7010fc6277d98e774f87185ef495, https://si.imgix.net/6666b8ff/uploads/origins/3a6bdd52-c686-4f28-a8af-15ae177129a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b44c87adda8e86f5c6c7f429a21564c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6666b8ff/uploads/origins/3a6bdd52-c686-4f28-a8af-15ae177129a9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1d4356a83ac8f0b31bc792a32115c56 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Could you please draw my two ninja boy characters, Mist and Raven? The references are attached below.\nThe orange one, Mist (17 y/o), has a relatively calm and less-talk personality, while the blue one, Raven (16 y/o), is outgoing and somewhat naughty. They are battle partners from a very young age.\nI hope you can draw a chibi illustration for each of them. You can choose the theme and scene freely, but I hope their scenes could match each other.\nHere are some options for you to refer to: battle stances, eating their favorite snacks (dango for Mist, ramen for Raven), beach outfits, Japanese summer festival outfits, etc.\nYou can choose one from the above, and it is welcome if you want to draw multiple themes! Also, it's okay if you have your own choices not from the list above.\nIf possible I would like a separate output for each character. Others that are not requested in detail are entirely up to your choice.\nThanks a lot for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1QBrm3u6P2jLlAwK3lKpkJ57MRLH-T4zf?usp=share_link", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@momo_mzm/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/aff659bd/uploads/origins/d195c23b-a262-4709-9de1-9d71d09adf01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5776b886eeadbb9b2532132c0dd41f1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/aff659bd/uploads/origins/d195c23b-a262-4709-9de1-9d71d09adf01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d5776b886eeadbb9b2532132c0dd41f1, https://si.imgix.net/aff659bd/uploads/origins/d195c23b-a262-4709-9de1-9d71d09adf01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a7c0a0da304f7bbfec853afbd699282c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aff659bd/uploads/origins/d195c23b-a262-4709-9de1-9d71d09adf01?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a22b703aa301b1fe7228d83bd7c0dfb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "前回はめちゃめちゃ可愛いイラストありがとう！！\nこひももちゃんにもう一つリクエストしたいって思っていて，\n僕のキャラが歌っているイラストを描いてもらいたいです！\n\n歌の動画の挿絵に使いたいから，縦長よりは横長(16:9)，あるいは1:1だと見やすいのかな？\nという事情はあるにはあるけど，画像のサイズとかは基本的にお任せします！\nよろしくお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@momo_mzm/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/440edfb0/uploads/origins/7bb6f2ee-4a7a-4b97-b10c-7e2a889d24d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d17454366aafcbc3168f8567a8cb977", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/440edfb0/uploads/origins/7bb6f2ee-4a7a-4b97-b10c-7e2a889d24d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d17454366aafcbc3168f8567a8cb977, https://si.imgix.net/440edfb0/uploads/origins/7bb6f2ee-4a7a-4b97-b10c-7e2a889d24d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b08c549ae1f66d67b2badb9aa79ee52f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/440edfb0/uploads/origins/7bb6f2ee-4a7a-4b97-b10c-7e2a889d24d7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c814293dc1493e0edf6b699ff6f3894c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "6月で配信初めて半年だから，半年記念で何か新衣装を出せたらいいなぁと思ってます！\nIRIAMのイベントで和風の背景を頂けたから，和風の新衣装がいいなぁって考えてるんだけど，描いていただけたらとっても嬉しいです！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}